Not strictly involved with this bug, but if you over can't sleep, you can look at pytest's generated rewritten ast, converted back to python with [these instructions](https://gist.github.com/tomviner/c3537c2f2b2b8172f83e) (now updated for Python 3).

For a failing version of your test @Shinkenjoe it generates this:

```
py.test test_matrix.py -s
